WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.101
President Trump
has tweeted a lot

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.102
of ridiculous things recently,

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.503
but perhaps the most ridiculous

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:06.306
was this tweet from Thursday...

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.645
Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.514
-Hi, Seth.
-Hi, Amber.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.815
What do you think
about Trump saying

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:16.949
he's done more for women

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.984
than any American president
in history?

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:20.553
-I think he's correct.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.422
-You don't disagree
with that statement?

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.090
-Why should I?

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.125
It's true.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.126
[ Upbeat jazz plays ]

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.193
-It is?

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:30.830
-It is.
-How is that possible?

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.364
What has he done?

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:34.500
-What has Trump done for women?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.601
Well...

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.671
♪♪

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.939
He did this...

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.807
♪♪

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.242 line:0%
He did that...

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.145 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:47.780 line:0%
He did this and this and this...

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.782 line:0%
Don't you forget about that...

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:53.719 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:56.222
-But those are all bad things.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.924
-He didn't say he's done
good things for women.

00:00:58.924 --> 00:01:03.329
He just no president
has done more, and he's right.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.798
No president has done more
for women.

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:07.400
To make our lives worse!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.036
♪♪

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.437
He's done this...

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.205
♪♪

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:14.640
He's done that...

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.409
♪♪

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.212
He said this and this
and this...

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.280
Don't you forget about that...

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.283
♪♪

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.084
-Wow.
That is a lot.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.419
-It sure is.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.887
-Do you have more?

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.723
-Seth, I can do this forever!

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.358
♪♪

00:01:33.358 --> 00:01:35.261 line:0%
He also did this and this

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.929 line:0%
and this and this

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.931 line:0%
and this.
[ Clapping ]

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:40.566 line:0%
Can you believe he did

00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:41.934 line:0%
