00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:33.185 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:33.185 --> 00:02:43.195 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:43.195 --> 00:02:50.169 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:51.237 line:0%
He did that?

